sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant realtime
  participant pf_mosquitto
  participant alert_processing_engine as APE
  participant dbserver
  participant data_interconnector
  participant ape_timescaledb as TimescaleDB
  participant expresso_server
  participant apigateway
  participant ext_web_clients as Web browser
  realtime->>pf_mosquitto: MQTT 1883: real-time object data
  pf_mosquitto-->>alert_processing_engine: MQTT 1883: subscribed object data
  alert_processing_engine->>dbserver: HTTP 8050: enrich with object and snapshot data
  alert_processing_engine->>pf_mosquitto: MQTT 1883: alert messages (and debug messages when PUBLISH_DEBUG_MSGS=true)
  pf_mosquitto-->>data_interconnector: MQTT 1883: subscribed data
  data_interconnector->>ape_timescaledb: PostgreSQL 5432: ingested records (PF_TIMESCALE_ENABLED=1)
  ext_web_clients->>apigateway: HTTPS/HTTP: Expresso UI event views
  apigateway->>expresso_server: HTTP 8456: proxied /api/expresso
  expresso_server->>alert_processing_engine: HTTP 5380: APE events integration
  expresso_server->>ape_timescaledb: PostgreSQL 5432: event queries
  expresso_server-->>apigateway: HTTP: response
  apigateway-->>ext_web_clients: HTTPS/HTTP: response
